Z||000000||Robert||06-25-2000||10:07 PM||||Having lost in the second round of a tennis tournament, I had an afternoon free.  I jumped on my bike and rode over to the BART (Bay Area Rapid Transit) to spend the afternoon in San Francisco.  I should have remembered the news reports about today being “Gay Pride Day” including a BIG parade.  <BR>If you are over 18 and have an open mind, click on the picture below of me and my NEW best friends.<P><BR>[URL= <A HREF="http://community.webshots.com/album/2527052ZLEYCuFpbp]" TARGET=_blank>http://community.webshots.com/album/2527052ZLEYCuFpbp]</A>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P6250108.jpg">      [/URL] <P><BR>I give up,Haze_Performance how do I get the picture to be the button?<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 06-25-2000).]||||reg||10
