Z||000006||Robert||06-27-2000||10:46 PM||||The cost was $2.   Actually they were a pretty cool bunch of guys.  The one on the far left of me is a computer programmer during the week.  They get together for the weekends and make a couple of bucks and have some fun.  I watched them for a short time, and saw them take in over $20.<P>Has anyone checked out the link above my picture? There are a lot more photos there.  Just hit the "Slide Show" button on the upper left and sit back and enjoy.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I just looked at the slide show at the link above and it seems that Webshots has deleted some of my more outrageous shots, I guess Webshots doesn’t want me the share what 750,000 people in San Francisco saw.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 06-28-2000).]||||reg||1
