Z||000009||frontal lobe||06-28-2000||02:33 PM||||What kind of picture will $5 buy you????<P>I've actually been down there by the wharf and seen some of those people.  The silver painted guy that acts like a machine or robot or whatever he is supposed to be is REALLY LAME.  <P>I've also seen early teens come down by the HUGE LINES waiting for the trolley stop who come down and "dance" and want you to give them money for it.  Sorry, kids.  Also EXTREMELY lame.<P>The guys in the pictures couldn't own Fieros unless they had the t-tops, due to their hair.||||reg||1
